description: Markdown docs are optional context; no mandatory sync with every code change.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Documentation

- **`docs/milestones.md`** — delivery tracker (operational, not a spec).
- **`docs/dev-log.md`** — dated execution notes.
- **`docs/README.md`** — short index; see also root `README.md`.
- **`docs/archive/**`** — historical material; do not treat as current product truth.

Do **not** assume markdown in the repo matches the implementation. When you change code, **you are not required** to update `.md` files unless the task explicitly includes documentation work.

If you edit markdown for humans, keep it short. Any remaining narrative docs should state that the source of truth is the code (see `agent-code-source-of-truth.mdc`).
